WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Hold Control + Option.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Say the task you want done on your Mac.

00:08.000 --> 00:13.000
ipop.ai routes the request to a local action or an AI agent.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
The result appears in the app you asked for.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
For bigger work, one prompt can launch multiple background sessions.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
You can inspect the sessions while your Mac keeps moving.
